E
bar bottle cherry oak~
   The bar is centered in the tavern, with eight bar stools on the customer
side.  It seems to have been built from a really beautiful cherry oak, with
decorative sculpting around the white stone covered top.  There are a multitude
of various types of liquor and ale behind the counter, ready to be served.  
The way the light shines down upon the bar, it appears to be an oasis in the
desert.  It's extremely hard to believe that this bar is underground.  There is
absolutely no way this huge piece of furniture could have been moved here.  
Which makes it even more extraordinary, because it's obvious it was created
down below.    
~
